{"id":"f3fdd55235f4984e","group":"92","path":"92/92-thm-diagonal-lemma.md","title":"Diagonal Lemma","display":"thm-diagonal-lemma — Diagonal Lemma","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-thm-diagonal-lemma","aliases":["92-thm-diagonal-lemma"],"display":"thm-diagonal-lemma — Diagonal Lemma","depends_on":["[[92-df-g-system]]","[[92-df-diagonal-function]]","[[92-df-formula]]","[[92-df-sentence]]","[[92-df-provable]]","[[92-df-godel-numbering]]","[[92-df-numeral]]","[[92-df-signature]]","[[92-df-free-variable-function]]","[[92-df-substitution]]","[[92-df-robinson-arithmetic]]","[[92-lem-fixed-point]]","[[92-df-theory-set]]"],"source":"第 VIII 章 pp. 102–103（PDF 119–120）；本地直接代入呈现","source_status":"原书内容的本地重构"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-thm-diagonal-lemma"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-thm-diagonal-lemma</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-diagonal-lemma — Diagonal Lemma"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e0eabee5d77258a7\" href=\"?note=e0eabee5d77258a7\" title=\"92-df-g-system\">92-df-g-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6ad30e82597031a6\" href=\"?note=6ad30e82597031a6\" title=\"92-df-diagonal-function\">92-df-diagonal-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5a1bd470754681a7\" href=\"?note=5a1bd470754681a7\" title=\"92-df-formula\">92-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"90f32e29c9d553ed\" href=\"?note=90f32e29c9d553ed\" title=\"92-df-sentence\">92-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"51c43e0240787ebb\" href=\"?note=51c43e0240787ebb\" title=\"92-df-provable\">92-df-provable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" href=\"?note=2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" title=\"92-df-godel-numbering\">92-df-godel-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"b78092e29a02d697\" href=\"?note=b78092e29a02d697\" title=\"92-df-numeral\">92-df-numeral</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"d666a3e3ee6c8148\" href=\"?note=d666a3e3ee6c8148\" title=\"92-df-signature\">92-df-signature</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"b9e3d57e94ce36b7\" href=\"?note=b9e3d57e94ce36b7\" title=\"92-df-free-variable-function\">92-df-free-variable-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"725c1f1651ce9a00\" href=\"?note=725c1f1651ce9a00\" title=\"92-df-substitution\">92-df-substitution</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"468d35690d25ee42\" href=\"?note=468d35690d25ee42\" title=\"92-df-robinson-arithmetic\">92-df-robinson-arithmetic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"ced07f0d506d2066\" href=\"?note=ced07f0d506d2066\" title=\"92-lem-fixed-point\">92-lem-fixed-point</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"975b3aa9a1e08797\" href=\"?note=975b3aa9a1e08797\" title=\"92-df-theory-set\">92-df-theory-set</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"第 VIII 章 pp. 102–103（PDF 119–120）；本地直接代入呈现"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书内容的本地重构"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> (system G, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"e0eabee5d77258a7\" href=\"?note=e0eabee5d77258a7\" title=\"92-df-g-system\">92-df-g-system</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\">\\(\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_0\\in\\mathrm{Var}_G\">\\(v_0\\in\\mathrm{Var}_G\\)</span> with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FV}_G(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{v_0\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{FV}_G(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{v_0\\}\\)</span> (formula with at most one distinguished free variable)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Subst}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Subst}_G\\)</span> (capture-avoiding substitution)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar n\">\\(\\bar n\\)</span> (numeral for <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vdash\">\\(\\vdash\\)</span> (provability relation)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(G)\">\\(Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(G)\\)</span> (arithmetic-strength assumption; it holds for the fixed PA system <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}diagonal\\text{-}lemma}\\vdash\nQ\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(G)\\Longrightarrow\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{FV}_G(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{v_0\\}\\Longrightarrow\n\\exists\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\;\nG\\vdash\\bigl(\n\\psi\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Subst}_G(\\varphi,\\overline{\\ulcorner\\psi\\urcorner},v_0)\n\\bigr)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}diagonal\\text{-}lemma}\\vdash\nQ\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(G)\\Longrightarrow\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{FV}_G(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{v_0\\}\\Longrightarrow\n\\exists\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\;\nG\\vdash\\bigl(\n\\psi\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Subst}_G(\\varphi,\\overline{\\ulcorner\\psi\\urcorner},v_0)\n\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span> : 至多含指定自由变量<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_0\">\\(v_0\\)</span>的公式</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\psi\">\\(\\psi\\)</span> : 自引用句子</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ulcorner \\psi \\urcorner\">\\(\\ulcorner \\psi \\urcorner\\)</span> : <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\psi\">\\(\\psi\\)</span>的Gödel数</li>\n<li>对角化引理给出的是<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>中的可证等价；对象语言通过<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Subst}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Subst}_G\\)</span>接收Gödel数的numeral，而不是把公式写成元语言函数应用</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(G)\">\\(Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(G)\\)</span>使标准对角函数的内部图表示可用；本书固定的PA系统<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>满足该强度条件</li>\n<li>这是自引用的核心技术结果</li>\n<li>Gödel句子、Löb句子、Henkin句子都是对角化引理的应用</li>\n</ul>\n<p>算术强度核对：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(G)\">\\(Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(G)\\)</span> 表示每条 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span> 公理在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> 中可证，不要求是原始公理。当前 P.A. 采用六条基本公理加归纳，后继前身公理由归纳导出，见<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-15\" data-note=\"0a1ba58f66cc8d4e\" href=\"?note=0a1ba58f66cc8d4e\" title=\"92-lem-local-pa-proves-q\">92-lem-local-pa-proves-q</a>；若继续要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ax}(G)\">\\(Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ax}(G)\\)</span>，就无法把本条应用于当前固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Source\">[Source]</h2>\n<p>本地直接代入的自引用构造与原书强可定义对角函数机制对应。原书以包裹实例码操作证明同形结果；这里沿用本库的 Subst、素数幂编号与强图表示，不把具体字符串或编号当作相同。</p>\n<p>原书定位：第 VIII 章 pp. 102–103（PDF 119–120）；本地直接代入呈现。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Source","text":"[Source]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-g-system","status":"resolved","id":"e0eabee5d77258a7","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":""